{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36359","headline":"献王大夫 · 方干","name":"献王大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高情不与俗人知，耻学诸生取桂枝。\n荀宋五言行世早，巢由三诏出溪迟。\n操心已在精微域，落笔皆成典诰词。\n一鹗难成燕雀伍，非熊本是帝王师。\n贤臣虽蕴经邦术，明主终无谏猎时。\n莫道百僚忧礼绝，兼闻七郡怕天移。\n直缘材力头头赡，专被文星步步随。\n不信重言通造化，须臾便可变荣衰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}